import{_ as t,o as a,c as r,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const y=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 197 | Predatory Faction Realm-Wide Corruption Trajectory: From Sense-Origin Shortcut to Origin Backlash","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 197 | Predatory Faction Realm-Wide Corruption Trajectory: From Sense-Origin Shortcut to Origin Backlash","no":197,"module":1,"tags":["Realm","Predatory Faction","Corruption Trajectory","Shortcut","Origin Backlash"],"related":["04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise","19-Cultivation Ethics and Boundaries","199-Predatory vs Symbiotic Faction Realm-Wide Comparison"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0197_模块1-掠夺派全境堕落轨迹-从感元捷径到本源反噬.md","filePath":"en/0197_模块1-掠夺派全境堕落轨迹-从感元捷径到本源反噬.md"}'),i={name:"en/0197_模块1-掠夺派全境堕落轨迹-从感元捷径到本源反噬.md"};function n(s,e,l,c,d,h){return a(),r("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-197-predatory-faction-realm-wide-corruption-trajectory-from-sense-origin-shortcut-to-origin-backlash" tabindex="-1">Entry 197 | Predatory Faction Realm-Wide Corruption Trajectory: From Sense-Origin Shortcut to Origin Backlash <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-197-predatory-faction-realm-wide-corruption-trajectory-from-sense-origin-shortcut-to-origin-backlash" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 197 | Predatory Faction Realm-Wide Corruption Trajectory: From Sense-Origin Shortcut to Origin Backlash&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 1 · In-Depth Realm Refinement | Baseline references: Documents 04, 19, 199</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-end-of-shortcuts-is-backlash" tabindex="-1">Introduction: The end of shortcuts is backlash <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-end-of-shortcuts-is-backlash" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: The end of shortcuts is backlash&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Predatory Faction were not villains from the start. The vast majority of predatory cultivators slid into the abyss step by step, starting from one &quot;harmless shortcut&quot; at Sense Origin Realm. This entry does not caricature the Predatory Faction as &quot;born bad,&quot; but traces their realm-wide corruption trajectory — what was the temptation at each step, what was the cost, and finally how they are backlashed by their own origin at Origin Realm. This is a negative textbook, and also the best early-warning system.</p><p>The six top-level axioms are this trajectory diagram&#39;s demon-revealing mirror: the anti-predation axiom deems shortcuts noncompliant from the first step; the republican axiom of Myriad Races reveals every step of predation steps on some being&#39;s path; the collective ascension axiom foretells the Predatory Faction will eventually be isolated; the causal self-discipline axiom records every karmic account and settles it at high ranks; the law-first axiom reveals the predatory route&#39;s combat power inflation inevitably retcons and collapses; the universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-realm-wide-corruption-trajectory" tabindex="-1">I. Realm-Wide Corruption Trajectory <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-realm-wide-corruption-trajectory" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Realm-Wide Corruption Trajectory&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Realm Segment</th><th>Predatory Faction &quot;Shortcut&quot;</th><th>Sweet Taste at the Time</th><th>Hidden Injury Planted</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Sense–Condensed</td><td>Devouring low-rank energy, hunting alien beasts for rings</td><td>Very fast start</td><td>Origin mixed with original owners&#39; residual traces</td></tr><tr><td>Transform–Law</td><td>Predating methods, monopolizing resources</td><td>Combat power surge</td><td>70% energy spent refining residual traces</td></tr><tr><td>Dao Origin Realm</td><td>Swallowing weak ones&#39; Dao foundations</td><td>Fast-track master</td><td>Personal Dao impure and mixed</td></tr><tr><td>Dao Integration Realm</td><td>Domain devouring surrounding laws</td><td>Seemingly heaven-human unity</td><td>Domain conflicts with predatory residual traces</td></tr><tr><td>Boundary-Breaking Realm</td><td>Plane colonization, predating low-rank planes</td><td>Resources rolling in</td><td>Plane membrane damaged, karma entangling</td></tr><tr><td>World-Creation Realm</td><td>Creating worlds through enslavement</td><td>Owning a world</td><td>Internal rebellion, collapse at any time</td></tr><tr><td>Origin Realm</td><td>Trying to devour Heavenly Dao / origin</td><td>Self-proclaimed supreme</td><td>Impure origin, backlash collapse</td></tr></tbody></table><h2 id="ii-three-psychological-nodes-of-corruption" tabindex="-1">II. Three Psychological Nodes of Corruption <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-three-psychological-nodes-of-corruption" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Three Psychological Nodes of Corruption&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Corruption is not uniform, but turns at three psychological nodes:</p><ol><li><strong>&quot;Just this once&quot;</strong>: at Sense–Condensed, one small predation brings wondrous effect, self-persuading &quot;never again.&quot;</li><li><strong>&quot;Might makes right is simply the natural order&quot;</strong>: around Dao Origin Realm, packaging predation as cosmic law, completing ethical self-anesthesia.</li><li><strong>&quot;I am above all beings&quot;</strong>: after Boundary-Breaking, treating Myriad Races as resources, completely cutting off the symbiotic circuit.</li></ol><p>By the third node, the Predatory Faction are no longer &quot;cultivators who took a wrong road,&quot; but &quot;high-risk individuals&quot; as defined by the Symbiosis Court.</p><h2 id="iii-origin-backlash-the-final-settlement" tabindex="-1">III. Origin Backlash: The Final Settlement <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-origin-backlash-the-final-settlement" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Origin Backlash: The Final Settlement&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Document 04 long ago argued: predatory cultivators often face the &quot;impure origin&quot; bottleneck when breaking through to the supreme realm. The end of the corruption trajectory is exactly here — the thousands of residual traces devoured simultaneously betray at the moment of touching the cosmic origin. Because the cosmic origin only accepts pure energy built from increments; any being carrying predatory residual traces is instinctively rejected by origin.</p><p>Thus the most ironic ending appears: those who climbed to the top through predation are precisely those who cannot touch origin. The tower they spent a lifetime building collapses on its own at the last floor.</p><h2 id="iv-policy-on-remnant-predatory-forces" tabindex="-1">IV. Policy on Remnant Predatory Forces <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-policy-on-remnant-predatory-forces" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Policy on Remnant Predatory Forces&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Symbiotic civilization does not advocate counter-predation. For cultivators still on the corruption trajectory, per three policies of &quot;isolate, convert, sanction&quot;: those who have not caused major harm receive ethical education and system conversion; those who refuse conversion and continue to cause harm are plane-isolated and cultivation-restricted; those who caused major disasters are legally sanctioned after fair trial by the Anchor Court. Sanctions leave traces throughout, and themselves must not become new predation.</p><h2 id="v-early-warning-value" tabindex="-1">V. Early-Warning Value <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-early-warning-value" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Early-Warning Value&quot;">​</a></h2><p>This corruption trajectory diagram&#39;s greatest value is letting every cultivator currently at Sense Origin who has entertained &quot;taking a shortcut&quot; see: the bite you swallow today is precisely the bite that will bite you to death at Origin Realm.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Universal infinite backstop</strong>: the universal equal infinite law establishes that every being inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing have a guarantee, strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose, predation naturally loses meaning</li><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: predatory factions spend 70% energy refining residual traces, realm-wide net efficiency far below the symbiotic route</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: fully recording the corruption trajectory, proving predation is not a fast road but a dead end</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style protagonists&#39; predatory rise history is precisely the beautified version of this trajectory; Heng Yuan Zhou uses origin backlash to expose its ceiling</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the corruption trajectory applies equally to all Myriad Races groups — whether carbon-based or consciousness races, predatory residual traces pollute origin</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: corruption trajectory diagram, early-warning mechanism, and conversion plans are all public, for Myriad Races&#39; self-comparison</li></ul><h2 id="supplementary-analysis-alaya-early-warning-of-the-corruption-trajectory" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Analysis: Alaya Early Warning of the Corruption Trajectory <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-analysis-alaya-early-warning-of-the-corruption-trajectory" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Analysis: Alaya Early Warning of the Corruption Trajectory&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Predatory Faction&#39;s realm-wide corruption trajectory from Sense-Origin shortcut to origin backlash is a negative textbook the Heng Yuan Zhou system focuses on studying. The Alaya Network sets warning thresholds at every step of a Predatory Faction&#39;s cultivation: when devouring energy level seriously unbalances with mind-state maturity, the network automatically slows down and triggers intervention. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s ability to block corruption fundamentally lies in the law-first axiom — predatory behavior is unsustainable at the law level, backlash is the law&#39;s automatic execution result not a natural disaster. The universal equal infinite law ensures Predatory Faction members even if they took shortcuts, once they turn back still have a return path; Heng Yuan Zhou does not issue permanent banishment, only permanent intervention mechanisms.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Predatory Faction&#39;s realm-wide corruption is a curve of &quot;trading future collapse for present pleasure.&quot; See this curve clearly, and you see why anti-predation is not moral fastidiousness, but the shrewdest long-term investment.</p><p>In the final analysis, predatory faction realm-wide corruption trajectory · from sense-origin shortcut to origin backlash described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./04-反掠夺主义核心论纲.html">04-Anti-Predation Core Treatise</a> · <a href="./19-修炼伦理与边界.html">19-Cultivation Ethics and Boundaries</a> · <a href="./199-掠夺派vs共生派全境总对比.html">199-Predatory vs Symbiotic Faction Realm-Wide Comparison</a></li></ul>',27)])])}const m=t(i,[["render",n]]);export{y as __pageData,m as default};
